        1268,
        1499,
        1382
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, a state of emergency related to the effects of the COVID-19 pandemic and the recovery therefrom in New York City, declared in Emergency Executive Order No. 435, dated June 20, 2023, remains in effect; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
